ype":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#how-to-use-per-op-json","content":"source links (`source.flopscope`, `source.numpy`)"},"69":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-63","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#how-to-use-per-op-json","content":"operation metadata (`op.*`)"},"70":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-64","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#how-to-use-per-op-json","content":"normalized doc sections under `docs.sections[]`"},"71":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-65","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#how-to-use-per-op-json","content":"Fetch the per-op JSON when you need the full signature, summary, notes,\nparameter list, returns, or examples for a single function without loading the\nentire reference surface."},"72":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-66","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"**1. A global default budget is active automatically — use `BudgetContext` for control.**"},"73":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-67","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"A global default budget auto-activates when flopscope is imported, so quick\nscripts work without any setup. For precise budget control and namespacing,\nuse an explicit `BudgetContext`. Both forms are valid:"},"74":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-68","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"**2. Know what's free and what's counted.**"},"75":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-69","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"Free (0 FLOPs): `zeros`, `ones`, `reshape`, `transpose`, `copy`,\n`random.seed`, `random.get_state`, `random.set_state`, `random.default_rng`."},"76":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-70","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"Custom cost (numel FLOPs): `array`, `linspace`, `arange`, `concatenate`, `where`.\nThese are NOT free — each charges `numel(output)` FLOPs against the budget."},"77":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-71","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"Counted: `einsum`, `dot`, `matmul`, `exp`, `log`, `add`, `multiply`, `sum`,\n`mean`, all `linalg.*`, all `fft.*`, `sort`, `argsort`, `trace`,\n`unique`, set ops (`in1d`, `isin`, etc.), `histogram`, `random.*` sampling."},"78":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-72","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"Blocked: `geterr`, `seterr`, `savetxt`, `loadtxt`, and 27 others. These raise\n`AttributeError`. (`save`/`load`/`savez`/`savez_compressed` are supported and\npickle-free — see the Saving & Loading guide.)"},"79":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-73","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"When in doubt, check `ops.json`, the relevant `/api-data/ops/<slug>.json`, or the API Reference."},"80":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-74","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"**3. Use `flops.accounting.*` to estimate costs before running.**"},"81":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-75","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"These are pure functions — no `BudgetContext` needed."},"82":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-76","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type